{"id":"661261","name":"紫菜虾仁炒饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661261/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉饼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"腊肠","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫菜下锅小火两面煎至变色，再放入袋子捏碎备用。","img":"images/661261/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鲜虾去虾头和虾壳，再改刀切小粒。","img":"images/661261/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉饼切小块备用。","img":"images/661261/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"腊肠切小块。","img":"images/661261/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"碗中打入鸡蛋搅拌均匀。","img":"images/661261/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入虾仁炒至变色后盛出。","img":"images/661261/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡蛋炒散。","img":"images/661261/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入肉饼一起翻炒。","img":"images/661261/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入腊肠。","img":"images/661261/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒香。","img":"images/661261/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入提前煲好的米饭。","img":"images/661261/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将配料和米饭翻炒均匀。","img":"images/661261/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入虾仁和紫菜。","img":"images/661261/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"翻炒均匀后加入葱花即可。","img":"images/661261/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661261/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661261/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661261/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}